  "description": "REPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES 8AVIO REVO combines high performance with specific solutions to make this carbon frame suitable for use by all athletes and competitors in the road world, remaining faithful to the tradition and style of Bottecchia racing bikes. The more comfortable endurance geometry makes it ideal for competitions and long distance races. 8AVIO REVO is made with double-mold DMMT technology which gives the product greater resistance and reduced weight. The innovative Multi Performance Brakes system allows the frame to be assembled with both traditional caliper brakes and the new disc brakes. This technology, together with the integrated fork, make the 8AVIO REVO ultra-modern, maximizing design and technicality. IDEAL FOR Designed to comfortably tackle long-distance outings with a stable and reliable vehicle, with easy and safe handling. PERFECT FOR YOU IF 8AVIO REVO is the perfect road bike for those who are passionate about the road world or simply looking for a competitive product, without having to give up the pluses of the superior models in the road sector. High performance, within everyone's reach.",
